; ============================================================================
; fib C SAFE -- D1-ALIGNMENT-CONDITIONAL FLOOR  A/B  (the (d) lever)
; Attacks the 2 remaining give-backs the vol filter MISSED (directional drift):
;   Mar-13 buys -$2,029 (counter-D1, never recovered -> CORRECTLY cut, keep tight)
;   May-7 sells -$2,850 (D1-aligned, reverted to 4329 -> WRONGLY cut, should ride)
; (d) widens the floor ONLY for D1-aligned baskets; counter-D1 keeps the tight 30%.
; EA: Marius Hedger M5 v1.0 fib C SAFE (build 2026-06-17)  |  GOLD M5  |  EVERY TICK
; Period Dec2025-Jun2026.  USE "Slow complete algorithm" (NOT genetic).
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Built on the (a)+(c) stage-1 WINNER. Swept (8 passes):
;   UseD1AlignedFloor {off,on}   off-rows = the $6,802 (a)+(c) CONTROL baseline
;   D1AlignedFloorMult {1.5,2.0,2.5,3.0}  floor 30% -> 45/60/75/90% for aligned baskets
; GOAL: a pass that beats the $6,802/PF1.53/38%DD control on net AND/OR DD.
; >>> AFTER stage-2 finishes: update VolRegimeMult + VolFloorMaxMult below to the
;     stage-2 refined winner, THEN run this A/B on top of it. (Seeded here with
;     the stage-1 winner: VolRegimeMult=2.5, VolFloorMaxMult=2.0.)
; Report per pass: Net, PF, max equity DD %, Recovery Factor.
; ============================================================================

